(text "C401-C404 sit at U1 pads 11, 43, 54 and 64, respectively. C405 and C406 sit at VDDA1, C407 and C408 at VDDA2." (at 16 184.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 19430a02-ca22-5f4a-a0c4-575ae6b3b914))
(text "L401 is 2 nH, 35 milliohms max and 2 A rated at 25 C. Keep C410 close to VDDA3/4 and scope the local rail under radio load." (at 16 189.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c554f2fe-8162-5d60-8c2c-40bca67e8fa4))
(text "C413/C414 at U1 pad 30 and C415/C416 at pad 34 bypass the internal PSRAM LDO. C417 bypasses its output at pad 35." (at 16 194.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 9a6073d9-6255-516e-918b-ad5f815bdcce))
(text "Provide at least 600 mA at the processor 3.3 V supply. Check combined radio, display, LEDs and audio load on the battery converter." (at 16 199.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid abb6df9c-42bf-5bca-a48d-921743e8f663))
(embedded_fonts no))
